  "body": "Currently, if no database configuration is provided, Synapse will default that configuration to `{\"name\": \"sqlite3\", \"args\": {}}` which will produce an error (because it's missing a `database` argument). Instead, it should raise a `ConfigError` explaining that this part of the configuration is required.",
